Description: Mock Waze manifest: foreground-service and notification permissions, the report screen and the timing intent used by the emulator tests

Inputs: Android build
Outputs: Permissions and components of the mock Waze app
External Sources: Claude Fable 5.1
Attributions:

Creation 11/5/2026 - Blake Pennel and Claude Fable 5.1:
